# FastAPI Rules

## API responsibility

FastAPI is the transport layer.

Keep endpoint functions focused on:

- request validation;
- combining request fields;
- invoking application or inference functions;
- converting domain errors into HTTP responses;
- returning documented response structures.

Do not place model or preprocessing implementation inside endpoints.

## Application entrypoint

The application entrypoint is:

```text
api/app.py
